or, G-Minor trill\",\n      \"translation\": \"Server is solid! Fiber-optic lines are tight! Temperature is low. Good, good, good! No leaks!\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c2\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"08:30 AM\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Rocky, are all home automation schedules active?\",\n      \"chords\": \"\342\231\251 \342\231\252 C-Major Arpeggio, C5 slide\",\n      \"timestamp_relative\": \"2 hours ago\",\n      \"translation\": \"Yes, light schedules active! Hydroponic pumps are pumping, and the smart blinds closed when Sol got too bright. Smart house, question? Yes!\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c3\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"Yesterday\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Rocky, do we need block list updates for local movies?\",\n      \"chords\": \"\342\231\253 \342\231\254 F-Sharp minor, falling trill\",\n      \"translation\": \"No block lists, perfect directory sync! All video files are ready to stream on big TV.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"
