  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Layout**\n\nI\'m focusing now on extracting the components. The plan is for modularity and robustness. Layout is my current focus, specifically for an 85\" TV. I\'m prioritizing readability and clean borders. I\'m thinking of creating a simple sidebar navigation, using vertical options with accompanying icons.\n\n\n**Refining the Sidebar**\n\nI\'m now implementing the sidebar and thinking about interactions. I\'ve designed a sleek, flat sidebar like Apple TV. When focused, an item will highlight with a modern glass backdrop and a gentle scale animation. The menu options are ready: Daily Dashboard, Spotify, Movies List, TV Shows, Tasklists, Tasklist Detailed, Grocery List, Calendar, and Meet Rocky. Finally, full keyboard navigation with arrow keys and Enter is being added for a premium TV remote experience.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
