  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Hover States**\n\nOkay, I\'m defining how to track the sidebar\'s states. I\'m focusing on \"Hover\" and \"Focus\" interactions. I\'ll combine these under a single flag, `isExpanded`. Right now, I\'m setting up `isHovered` with `useState(false)`.\n\n\n**Refining Interaction Triggers**\n\nI\'ve refined the interaction triggers, deciding on `onMouseEnter/onMouseLeave` for `isHovered` and `onFocusCapture/onBlurCapture` for `isFocused`. This will allow more robust handling of focus states. I\'ve been considering the layout transition design and have decided to hide text elements. I\'m focusing on crafting a beautifully styled and functional sidebar. Now, I\'m thinking of standard Tailwind classes.\n\n\n"
