detail drawers for remote/couch users.\n\n#### 4. **Simplified Eridian Advisor (Rocky)**\n*   Transformed the complex, busy metrics console into a focused transcription and messaging interface.\n*   Centered around the iconic **pentamerous symmetry organism SVG** with real-time mood and body temperature telemetry.\n*   **Decrypted Chord Feed**: The speech logs and translator input are given full prominence, making chatting and issuing system actions to Rocky interactive."
