iew.tsx` for consistent visual styling. I\'ve switched the text color of the thermostat temperature to emerald, along with the security armed icon, mirroring the new thematic elements. Also, I added a shadow effect to the security button\'s armed state to highlight the emerald theme.\n\n\n**Modifying Telemetry Visuals**\n\nI\'ve updated the Asteria OS Core Telemetry visuals in `DailyOverview.tsx`. The background and text colors are now emerald, consistent with the new theme, and the CPU usage percentage is emerald too. I\'m working to integrate these components visually with the new styling.\n\n\n**Applying Visual Harmony**\n\nI\'ve just been refining the Spotify-inspired theme in `DailyOverview.tsx` further. I\'ve updated the background gradient on a key element to use an emerald gradient and added a subtle shadow to emphasize it. I also modified the calendar link and date to use emerald styling for better visual consistency.\n\n\n**Refining UI Details**\n\nI\'m now integrating new visuals into `DailyOverview.tsx`. I\'ve added a radial gradient, emerald-tinted, to a specific section for better emphasis. It includes a subtle shadow and I\'m updating its placement in the layout. I\'ve also swapped the old hover state for a new emerald one, keeping visual consistency.\n\n\n**Confirming System Integrity**\n\nNo atmospheric leaks detected! I just received this confirmation and I\'m very pleased with the result. I am now proceeding with no further changes to this section. I can proceed to the next area of focus.\n\n\n"
