er, custom elements with `tabIndex={0}` necessitate a manual `.click()` event dispatch on `Enter`, ensuring all clickable components behave predictably. I\'m also planning the escape functionality for moving back in the stack.\n\n\n**Expanding Backwards Actions**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `Backspace` and `Escape` keypresses, realizing they should automatically trigger a back action (e.g., to `tasklists` or `daily-dashboard`)! This approach is generic and incredibly responsive across diverse elements. I\'m verifying proper scrolling behavior to ensure focused off-screen items are always visible using `scrollIntoView`. This simple change makes remote control feel like a premium experience.\n\n\n"
